<title>UK: BAe pretax profit rises in year.</title>
<headline>BAe pretax profit rises in year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		74.3		   vs 48.8</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 15.625		 vs 12.5</p>
<p> Pretax and excepts     456		    vs 330</p>
<p> Pretax		     425		    vs 234</p>
<p> Turnover		   6.46 bln	     vs 5.74 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 410 and 425 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - British Aerospace Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
